The Weft is a collection of four to six adventurers that have traveled across [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]]. They're registered with [[Org/Althane/The Guild|The Guild]] and have completed some quests in the name of justice. Among them are [[People/Althane/Lev|Lev]], [[People/Althane/Henrik|Henrik]], [[People/Althane/Divex|Divex]], [[People/Althane/Dawnmonger|Dawnmonger]], and the two [[Bestiary/Kaathe|Kaathe]] orbs [[People/Althane/Schism|Schism]] and [[People/Althane/SeRaan|SeRaan]].

They keep a base at [[Geography/Althane/The Hollow/Lava Ruin/index|the lava ruin]], where the Heart they woke as [[Geography/Althane/The Hollow/Lava Ruin/Damien|Damien]] forges items out of divine energy.

Immix named them "the Left" on a broadcast across [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]], showing a wanted-poster likeness of each of them beside a dossier of their deeds, their strength and the [[Phenomena/Althane/Godpiercer|godpiercer]] they hold. They are known now to [[Org/Althane/The First House|the First House]] and to whoever else was watching, though not what they are after. Divex wears the pearl [[People/Althane/Crystal Earring|Crystal Earring]], and the Weft carry a caged [[Bestiary/Mimics|tzitzimitl]]. They freed the Kaathe [[People/Althane/Halidex Op-B|Hali]] and [[People/Althane/Tennobrin Er-K|Tenno]] from the vats of [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/RC3|RC3]], and both now travel with them.
